        -: 1099:   *  `!(v[i] > 3)` is true.
        -: 1100:   *
        -: 1101:   *  The not1/unary_negate combination works on predicates taking a single
        -: 1102:   *  argument.  The not2/binary_negate combination works on predicates taking
